{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261025/photo/bkn-20261025122936508-1025_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261025125739\"/><p>今年首三季有超過1500名電單車司機在交通意外中傷亡。</p><p>運輸署今日(25日)表示，今年首三季有超過1,500名電單車司機在交通意外中受傷，其中有15人死亡，較去年同期多。署方指，電單車車身相對較窄、保護較少，提醒電單車司機駕駛時須格外謹慎，做足安全措施。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:49.229334+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T04:29:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:41:12.422015+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:31.854382+00:00","content_hash":"46d659d52f7b5fd9dd7d978a21a822df7e1b440f261842deb0f2d61790d0692a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}